አሁን ሁለቱም ክፍሎች (Frontend እና Backend API) ራን አድርገው በቀጥታ እየሰሩ ነው! 🚀

---

### 🌐 አሁኑኑ በብሮውዘርህ ከፍተህ የምትሞክራቸው ገጾች፦

#### 1. የፊት ለፊት ገጾች (Frontend - Next.js)
👉 **ሊንኩን ክፈት፦** [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)

* **መነሻ ገጽ (Landing Page)፦** [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)
* **የኮርሶች ዝርዝር (Course Catalog)፦** [http://localhost:3000/courses](http://localhost:3000/courses)
  - በዘርፍ (Programming, Design, CAD, Marketing) አጣራና ፈልግ
* **የአንድ ኮርስ ዝርዝርና የክፍያ ስክሪንሾት መጫኛ፦** [http://localhost:3000/courses/course-1](http://localhost:3000/courses/course-1)
  - **"አሁኑኑ ይመዝገቡ (Enroll Now)"** የሚለውን ተጭነህ የቴሌብር/CBE የክፍያ ፎርም ሞክረው
* **የፍሪላንስ ሥራ ገበያ (AppWorks Jobs)፦** [http://localhost:3000/jobs](http://localhost:3000/jobs)
* **ለሥራ ፕሮፖዛል ማቅረቢያ፦** [http://localhost:3000/jobs/job-1](http://localhost:3000/jobs/job-1)
* **አዲስ ሥራ መለጠፊያ (Post a Job)፦** [http://localhost:3000/jobs/post](http://localhost:3000/jobs/post)
* **ሰርተፊኬት ማረጋገጫ (QR Verification)፦** [http://localhost:3000/verify](http://localhost:3000/verify)
* **መመዝገቢያና መግቢያ (Auth)፦** [http://localhost:3000/auth/register](http://localhost:3000/auth/register) እና [http://localhost:3000/auth/login](http://localhost:3000/auth/login)

---

#### 2. የተጠቃሚዎች ዳሽቦርድ (Dashboards)
* **🎓 የተማሪ ዳሽቦርድ፦** [http://localhost:3000/dashboard/student](http://localhost:3000/dashboard/student) (የትምህርት ሂደት መከታተያ፣ የክፍያ ታሪክ)
* **🛡️ የአድሚን ዳሽቦርድ፦** [http://localhost:3000/dashboard/admin](http://localhost:3000/dashboard/admin) (የተማሪዎችን የክፍያ ስክሪንሾት አይተህ **Approve** ወይም **Reject** የምታደርግበት)
* **👨‍🏫 የመምህር ዳሽቦርድ፦** [http://localhost:3000/dashboard/teacher](http://localhost:3000/dashboard/teacher) (የኮርሶች አስተዳደር እና ገቢ)

---

#### 3. የጀርባ አሰራር (Backend API - NestJS)
👉 **የ API አድራሻ፦** `http://localhost:4000/api`
* `POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register` (ተጠቃሚ መመዝገቢያ)
* `POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login` (መግቢያ)
* `GET http://localhost:4000/api/courses` (የኮርሶች ዳታ)
* `POST http://localhost:4000/api/payments/submit` (የክፍያ መላኪያ)
* `GET http://localhost:4000/api/certificates/verify/DM-2026-89412` (ሰርተፊኬት ማረጋገጫ)
